KG42.register("slice-clusters-d4fcfcd94784586e4c0e4b78",{"id":"26-battery_flexibility::v142-d-CL001","paper":"26-battery_flexibility","title":"Flexi User community surplus electricity trading, allocation, and revenue-and-expenditure interface","source_pointer":"/clusters/101","node_ids":["COMP-970463b73869ba14","COMP-f8b6dd7cb8a348ad","COMP-8c75001a94cd69f5","COMP-a774da994c2ca212","COMP-aa07cfb9f341dafd","COMP-3fcd5e2d02ec7c3f","COMP-739917e3869e45a6"],"rule_refs":["26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R001","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R002","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R003","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R004","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R006","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R007","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R005"],"visible_rule_refs":["26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R001","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R002","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R003","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R004","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R006","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R007","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R005"],"suppressed_rule_refs":[],"edges":[{"global_edge_id":"S-a83a3c72f416e2ff","source":"COMP-f8b6dd7cb8a348ad","target":"COMP-970463b73869ba14","type":"links","assertion_ids":["26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R001::E::v141-c-R001-E001"],"rule_refs":["26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R001"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-e0791e9487c77128","source":"COMP-f8b6dd7cb8a348ad","target":"COMP-8c75001a94cd69f5","type":"links","assertion_ids":["26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R002::E::v141-c-R002-E001"],"rule_refs":["26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R002"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-19a42294ea62ca79","source":"COMP-739917e3869e45a6","target":"COMP-8c75001a94cd69f5","type":"conditional_on","assertion_ids":["26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R007::E::v141-c-R007-E001"],"rule_refs":["26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R007"],"internal":false}],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"interface_annotations":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO001","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e01"],"rationale":"The same design definition simultaneously allows consumer trading and specifies a dynamic local price; the consumer permission completes the participant scope to which the trading price applies."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO002","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e01","v141-b-g01-e03","v141-b-g01-e11","v141-b-g01-e18"],"rationale":"The prosumer permission and the prohibition on grid feeding define the entities and destination of surplus electricity trading, and are complementary to the intra-community trading scope of the execution chain."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO003","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C003","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e03","v141-b-g01-e18"],"rationale":"The product definition constrains the surplus electricity traded by the execution chain and the community scope. R006-C003 corresponds only to Eq. (5) in R002-C004; the two complete constraint objects cannot be judged identical."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO004","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::x_X","v141-c-R001::x::x_X_p","v141-c-R001::x::x_I","v141-c-R001::x::x_I_p","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C004"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-X001","v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-X002","v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-X003","v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-X004","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e15","v141-b-g01-e16","v141-b-g01-e17","v141-b-g01-e18"],"rationale":"The two chains reference the same model's household total, bilateral direction, and loss-adjustment relations, connecting allocation and trading meanings; this mapping does not prove that a separately described physical execution sequence exists."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO005","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R005::theta::p_p2p","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-P001","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e16"],"rationale":"The source explicitly uses the adjusted shadow price obtained from the independent household benchmark for that household's P2P purchase price, supporting the interface from pricing to trading application; the adjustment arithmetic remains unclosed."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO006","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R005::theta::p_G","v141-c-R005::theta::p_p2p"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::theta_p_G","v141-c-R001::theta::theta_p_p2p","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e19","v141-b-g02-e11","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g02-e21"],"rationale":"The source-defined grid price and local purchase price connect the pricing and community decision descriptions; the grid price enters the objective, while the local price retains only a qualitative input role and does not add an internal P2P objective coefficient."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO007","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R002::V::execution.energy_trade","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C004"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R007::V::execution.energy_trade","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e19"],"rationale":"The source links purchasing electricity from peers with buyer costs and seller revenue, supporting the functional assembly of trading and payment consequences, but does not support deriving a transaction-by-transaction payment formula."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO008","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e19"],"rationale":"The same paragraph explains the omission of the P2P term in Eq. (6) by the offset of intra-community payments and revenues, constituting a direct link between the accounting scope and the objective function."}],"annotation_policy":"Original D connections are annotations, not additional S edges.","empty_after_chain_suppression":false});
